{"sections":[{"slug":"纤维范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"纤维范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"纤维范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">纤维范畴是沿着一个参数范畴变化的一族范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直化</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">纤维范畴等同于参数范畴到范畴的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑函子</span> $p\\colon \\mathcal E \\to \\mathcal B$. <span lang=\"zh\">我们将用</span> $\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">中对象和态射的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">提升</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">来陈述纤维范畴的条件</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若对</span> $\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">中任意态射</span> $f \\colon X \\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的提升</span> $\\tilde{X}$, <span lang=\"zh\">都有</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">提升为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/推前","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">推前</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\tilde{f}\\colon \\tilde{X} \\to \\tilde{Y}$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $p$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">推前纤维范畴</span></strong>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若对</span> $\\mathcal B$ <span lang=\"zh\">中任意态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的提升</span> $\\tilde{Y}$, <span lang=\"zh\">都有</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">提升为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/推前","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\tilde{f}\\colon \\tilde{X} \\to \\tilde{Y}$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $p$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">拉回纤维范畴</span></strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}